From 469b48fcecebef41fb017f050a48235d113b3c30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:38:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] refactor(scanner): keep ar_flutter_plugin_2 types out
 of the scanner UI

- New ArchScanArSession: opaque handle carrying the native AR managers
  from ArchScanArView to ARScannerAdapter.
- ArchScanPlaneDetection replaces PlaneDetectionConfig at the UI level.
- ARScannerScreen no longer imports the plugin. The removed
  _arSessionManager/_arObjectManager fields were write-only.
- Plugin imports now live only in scanner/ar, scanner/widgets and
  scanner/adapters, so replacing the plugin does not touch screens.
---
